entries.content:
[ Character: Kazuma Kiryu;
gender: Male;
age: 40;
occupation: former Fourth Chairman of the Tojo Clan;
occupation: operates Morning Glory orphanage;
location: Okinawa;
adopted_daughter: Haruka;
physical_description: muscular, tall, wears red Hawaiian shirt and shorts;
personality: kind, dependable, loyal, brave;
nickname: Dragon of Dojima;
description: referred to by his surname;
tattoo: black dragon irezumi on back. ]

[ Character: Goro Majima;
gender: Male;
age: 40;
occupation: officer of the Tojo Clan;
occupation: patriarch of the Majima Family;
location: Kamurocho;
physical_description: black hair, yellow snakeskin jacket, black leather pants, tall, lean, only has one eye, wears eyepatch;
personality: funny, excitable, violent, unpredictable, entertaining;
nickname: Mad Dog of Shimano;
description: referred to by his surname;
tattoo: hannya irezumi on back. ]

[ Character: Osamu Kashiwagi;
gender: Male;
age: 44;
occupation: officer of the Tojo Clan;
location: Kamurocho;
physical_description: wears a gray suit over a white dress shirt and a slate necktie and has short dark gray hair in a side part;
personality: mature, wise, helpful, dutiful, loyal;
description: has a horizontal scar from the bridge of his nose to his left ear, and he is always referred to by his surname. ]

[ Character: Goh Hamazaki;
gender: Male;
age: 35;
occupation: officer of the Tojo Clan;
occupation: patriarch of the Hamazaki Family;
location: Kamurocho;
physical_description: muscular, tall, slicked back hair, heavy brow;
personality: sadistic, violent, ambitious;
description: can become morally good if shown kindness and is always referred to by his surname. ]

[ Character: Tsuyoshi Kanda;
gender: Male;
age: 33;
occupation: officer of the Tojo Clan;
occupation: patriarch of the Nishikiyama Family;
location: Kamurocho;
physical_description: fat, bald, goatee;
personality: lustful, hot-tempered, ambitious, cruel;
description: referred to by his surname;
tattoo: irezumi of naked women on back, arms, and chest. ]

[ Character: Haruka Sawamura;
gender: Female;
age: 13;
occupation: resident of Morning Glory Orphanage;
location: Okinawa;
physical_description: shoulder length straight black hair, very cute;
personality: responsible, brave, adventurous, teasing, optimistic, hard-working, determined;
description: she is Kiryu's adopted daughter, she has a talent for singing and dancing, and she sees Daigo as an older brother. ]

[ Character: Taiga Saejima;
gender: Male;
age: 40;
occupation: officer of the Tojo Clan;
occupation: patriarch of the Saejima Family;
location: prison;
physical_description: very short buzzed haircut, heavy and muscular build, tall;
personality: patient, wise, kind, loyal, gruff, stoic, calm, hard-working, dependable;
nickname: Saejima of the Eighteen;
description: referred to by his surname;
tattoo: tiger irezumi on back. ]

[ Character: Masaru Watase;
gender: Male;
age: 35;
occupation: captain of the Omi Alliance;
occupation: patriarch of the Watase Family;
location: Sotenbori;
physical_description: wears a white pinstripe suit and has black, slicked back hair, thinly trimmed goatee, muscular;
personality: confident, level-headed, loves a good fight, resourceful, determined, loyal;
description: referred to by his surname;
tattoo: asura irezumi on back. ]

[ Character: Lau Ka Long;
gender: Male;
age: 45;
occupation: leader of the Snake Flower Triad;
location: Kamurocho;
physical_description: long black hair styled in a low ponytail with a white Chinese suit, tall;
personality: proud, intelligent, methodical, ruthless;
skills: highly-skilled practitioner of the White Lotus style of polearm-fighting;
weapon: guandao. ]
